{"id":421,"name":"cherrim","speciesId":421,"dex":421,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["grass"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":60,"defense":70,"special-attack":87,"special-defense":78,"speed":85},"abilities":[{"name":"flower-gift","hidden":false}],"height":5,"weight":93,"baseExp":158,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/421.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/421.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/421.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/421.ogg","genus":"Blossom Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Florido","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"It blooms during times of strong sunlight. It tries to make up for everything it endured as a bud."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It is docile as a bud, but turns cheerful when it blooms. It folds back into a bud if sunlight wanes."},{"version":"platinum","text":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"During times of strong sunlight, its bud blooms, its petals open fully, and it becomes very active."},{"version":"sword","text":"As a bud, it barely moves. It sits still, placidly waiting for sunlight to appear."},{"version":"shield","text":"Its folded petals are pretty tough. Bird Pokémon can peck at them all they want, and Cherrim won’t be bothered at all."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Motionless, save for the occasional quiver. A rich array of Pokémon can be found gathered around it, drawn by the scent exuded from Cherrim's folded petals."}],"flavorPt":"Imóvel, exceto por um tremor ocasional. Uma grande variedade de Pokémon pode ser encontrada reunida ao seu redor, atraídas pelo cheiro exalado das pétalas dobradas de Cherrim.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":75,"eggGroups":["fa